<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11520" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπᾰρέσκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be disagreeable to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.38
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.6b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>displease,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				202d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				365d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀπαρέσαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					8.14.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ . . γάρ τι νεμεσσητὸν
				βασιλῆα ἄνδρ᾽ ἀπαρέσσασθαι</span> it is no disgrace for
			a king <i>to approve</i> a man (or, <i>to appease</i> a man of
			royal birth), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.183
			</span></i>, cf. Sch. and <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
			</span></i> ad loc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρέσκεσθαί τινι</span>”
				<i>to be displeased with,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					5.2.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.6.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
